  "_source": "COPY of camlooper.com/server/test/meeting-url-vectors.json (the relay server lives in the private workspace repo). Keep the two files identical; the server is the canonical source. canonical cross-language test vectors for the meeting-URL allowlist shared by the server (TS), the mobile app (TS) and the desktop app (Rust). Rules, in order, first failure wins: length (1..maxLength) -> charset (printable ASCII 0x21-0x7E, no backslash) -> scheme (literal https:// prefix, case-insensitive) -> parse (WHATWG URL) -> userinfo (must be empty) -> port (must be empty) -> host (exact match, or *.suffix on a label boundary; no trailing dot). Boundary-length cases are generated in test code from maxLength.",
